  "The air conditioning in the security cabin at Area 3 gate is not functioning, causing discomfort for the security personnel. This could affect their focus and performance, impacting overall security effectiveness.",
  "In the early morning of April 2nd, during the Eid Al-Fitr holiday, a theft occurred at the HIDC 2 warehouse. The perpetrators gained unauthorized access by cutting two openings in the warehouse temporary perimeter fence: The first opening was made near the tkSAC warehouse area. The thieves cut through 1 section of the fence, but no items were stolen from this side. The second opening was made near the subcontractor's (TCC) warehouse / storage area, where they cut through three sections of the fence. The thieves break the installed locks and forcibly entered the TCC warehouse and stole the listed materials below. They also attempted to break into two small doors belonging to tkSAC on the southern side of the warehouse. Although the locks were forced open, nothing was stolen from inside. Investigations confirmed that the thieves used a vehicle to transport the stolen items. The southern side of the warehouse was identified as the main entry and exit point. The incident was not detected by the night shift security guards or the Zone A gate security personnel. It was also confirmed that the thieves did not enter through the main gate.",
